<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear list for Restoration Druid Healer in Wrath of the Lich King Classic for Phase 2. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from Heroics, reputation rewards, and the new 10-man Raid loot added to Titan Rune Dungeons.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot-gear">Restoration Druid Healer Best in Slot Gear, Gems, and Enchants - Pre-Raid Phase 3</h2>Here is the best setup you can achieve without setting foot into a raid in Phase 3. While these are the best pieces that are achievable outside of raid, completing the set requires a lot of <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=2589/sidereal-essence">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_icediamond_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sidereal Essence</span></span></a>, <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a>, and gold.<br/>
<br/>If you want to skip the high price tag items, keep an eye out for the T8 tokens in dungeons, <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-791/valorous-nightsong-regalia">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Valorous Nightsong Regalia</span></a>. Both set bonuses are a good bump in strength to your healing. Then, scoop up any gear with spell power and haste. Both of these stats are about equal at pre-raid levels of gear, so just sum them together and see how it compares to what you're currently wearing.<br/>
<br/>Most important stat to watch is Haste Rating. There is a 735 or 856 cap depending on whether you take <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=16924/celestial-focus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_arcane_starfire.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Celestial Focus</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>Best use of gems is to socket <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40155/reckless-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reckless Ametrine</span></a> to your haste cap, then fill with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40113/runed-cardinal-ruby">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_37.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Runed Cardinal Ruby</span></a>. Sprinkle in a few <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40133/purified-dreadstone">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Purified Dreadstone</span></a> where the socket bonuses are strong.<br/>
<br/>Theres three items in this gear planner that are horde specific because of how phase 3 loot is structured. Not to worry, there are Alliance versions available with identical stats. See the list below the gear planner for links to these pieces.<br/>
<br/>
